              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2026-7246: click@8.1.0"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Pallets Click, versions 8.3.2 and below, contain a command injection vulnerability in the click.edit() function, allowing attackers to pass arbitrary OS commands from an unprivileged account."
