            {
              "id": "yaml.github-actions.security.github-actions-mutable-action-tag.github-actions-mutable-action-tag",
              "name": "GitHub Actions step uses a mutable tag or branch reference. Tags and branch names can be silently repointed by the action owner, enabling supply-chain attacks \u2014 as seen in the trivy-action and kics-gi",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "GitHub Actions step uses a mutable tag or branch reference. Tags and branch names can be silently repointed by the action owner, enabling supply-chain attacks \u2014 as seen in the trivy-action and kics-gi"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "GitHub Actions step uses a mutable tag or branch reference. Tags and branch names can be silently repointed by the action owner, enabling supply-chain attacks \u2014 as seen in the trivy-action and kics-github-action compromises. Pin the reference to a full 40-character commit SHA instead, e.g. `uses: actions/checkout@8ade135a41bc03ea155e62e844d188df1ea18608`."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "Review and remediate per Semgrep rule guidance.",
                "markdown": "**Remediation:** Review and remediate per Semgrep rule guidance."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "warning"
              },
              "properties": {
                "tags": [
                  "sast",
                  "semgrep"
                ],
                "category": "sast"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "python.lang.security.use-defused-xml-parse.use-defused-xml-parse",
              "name": "The native Python `xml` library is vulnerable to XML External Entity (XXE) attacks.  These attacks can leak confidential data and \"XML bombs\" can cause denial of service. Do not use this library to pa",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "The native Python `xml` library is vulnerable to XML External Entity (XXE) attacks.  These attacks can leak confidential data and \"XML bombs\" can cause denial of service. Do not use this library to pa"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "The native Python `xml` library is vulnerable to XML External Entity (XXE) attacks.  These attacks can leak confidential data and \"XML bombs\" can cause denial of service. Do not use this library to parse untrusted input. Instead  the Python documentation recommends using `defusedxml`."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "Review and remediate per Semgrep rule guidance.",
                "markdown": "**Remediation:** Review and remediate per Semgrep rule guidance."
              },
